because you need carbohydrates in order to gain weight. So if you only ate, you know,

00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:12,720
let's say you're not eating 80 carbs whatsoever, the chance you be, you know,

00:01:12,720 --> 00:01:17,200
pushing yourself to a state of pakexia or high. So you can't do that. You're going to have to eat

